<title>UK: Guatemala prices $150 million 10-year bond,+240 BP. [CORRECTED 15:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Guatemala prices $150 million 10-year bond,+240 BP. [CORRECTED 15:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manger BankBoston.</p>
<p> BORROWER    GUATEMALA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    03.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.6084   PAY DATE  S-04.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  75 BP     REOFFER    99.6084   SPREAD	+240 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>(Corrects pay frequency from Annual to Semi-Annual.)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
